## 3. 消息分发流程详解

### 3.1 消息分发的触发

消息分发是Pulsar中的一个核心流程，它由多个触发条件和精心设计的机制来保证消息的可靠投递。让我们深入了解其实现细节：

#### 3.1.1 Flow Control触发

1. **Flow请求处理**
```java
protected void handleFlow(CommandFlow flow) {
    checkArgument(state == State.Connected);
    
    CompletableFuture<Consumer> consumerFuture = consumers.get(flow.getConsumerId());
    if (consumerFuture != null && consumerFuture.isDone() 
            && !consumerFuture.isCompletedExceptionally()) {
        Consumer consumer = consumerFuture.getNow(null);
        if (consumer != null) {
            // 更新消费者的permits并触发消息读取
            consumer.flowPermits(flow.getMessagePermits());
        }
    }
}
```

2. **Dispatcher处理Flow请求**
```java
public void consumerFlow(Consumer consumer, int additionalNumberOfMessages) {
    // 在单独的线程中执行流控逻辑
    topic.getBrokerService().executor().execute(() -> {
        internalConsumerFlow(consumer, additionalNumberOfMessages);
    });
}

private synchronized void internalConsumerFlow(Consumer consumer, 
        int additionalNumberOfMessages) {
    // 检查消费者是否还存在
    if (!consumerSet.contains(consumer)) {
        return;
    }
    
    // 更新可用许可数并触发读取
    totalAvailablePermits += additionalNumberOfMessages;
    readMoreEntriesAsync();
}
```

#### 3.1.2 消息读取触发

1. **异步读取机制**
```java
public void readMoreEntriesAsync() {
    // 防止重复读取请求
    if (readMoreEntriesAsyncRequested.compareAndSet(false, true)) {
        topic.getBrokerService().executor().execute(() -> {
            readMoreEntriesAsyncRequested.set(false);
            readMoreEntries();
        });
    }
}
```

2. **读取条件检查**
```java
public synchronized void readMoreEntries() {
    // 检查各种读取条件
    if (cursor.isClosed()) {
        return;
    }
    if (isSendInProgress()) {
        // 避免在发送过程中重复读取
        return;
    }
    if (shouldPauseDeliveryForDelayTracker()) {
        // 延迟投递检查
        return;
    }
    if (topic.isTransferring()) {
        // 主题迁移中不读取
        return;
    }
    
    // 计算本次应该读取的消息数量
    int availablePermits = getAvailablePermits();
    if (availablePermits > 0) {
        readEntries(availablePermits);
    }
}
```

#### 3.1.3 读取完成触发

1. **读取完成回调**
```java
protected void readEntriesComplete(final List<Entry> entries, Object ctx) {
    // 在单独的线程中处理读取结果
    executor.execute(() -> {
        havePendingRead = false;
        
        // 动态调整读取批次大小
        if (readBatchSize < serviceConfig.getDispatcherMaxReadBatchSize()) {
            readBatchSize = Math.min(readBatchSize * 2, 
                    serviceConfig.getDispatcherMaxReadBatchSize());
        }
        
        // 分发消息给消费者
        Consumer currentConsumer = getActiveConsumer();
        if (currentConsumer != null) {
            dispatchEntriesToConsumer(currentConsumer, entries);
        }
    });
}
```

2. **消息分发触发**
```java
protected void dispatchEntriesToConsumer(Consumer consumer, List<Entry> entries) {
    // 发送消息并设置回调
    consumer.sendMessages(entries, batchSizes, batchIndexesAcks, 
            totalMessages, totalBytes, totalChunkedMessages, redeliveryTracker)
        .addListener(future -> {
            if (future.isSuccess()) {
                // 发送成功后触发下一轮读取
                readMoreEntries(consumer);
            }
        });
}
```

#### 3.1.4 重投递触发

1. **消息重投递请求**
```java
protected void handleRedeliverUnacknowledged(
        CommandRedeliverUnacknowledgedMessages redeliver) {
    Consumer consumer = getConsumer(redeliver.getConsumerId());
    if (consumer != null) {
        // 触发消息重投递
        consumer.redeliverUnacknowledgedMessages(
            redeliver.getMessageIdsList());
